  "prefLabel": "Plc 1002.31 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Professions Regulated by the Board of Natural Scientists",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1002.31 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Professions Regulated by the Board of Natural Scientists. The application processing and licensing fees found in Table 1002.31, below, shall apply to the professions regulated by the board of natural scientists under RSA 310-A:75-96:\n\nTable 1002.31 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Professions Regulated by the Board of Natural Scientists\n\nCategory | License Duration | Fee\n\nApplication processing and licensing for recognition as a soil scientist apprentice or wetland scientist apprentice under RSA 310-A:85:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of recognition | 2 years | $82\n\nSoil scientist certification or wetland scientist certification application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of certification | 2 years | $137\n\nSource. #13703, eff 8-1-23; ss by #14290, eff 7-1-25, EXPIRES: 7-1-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1000.html"
